{"id":"n58433-1-12","stage":1,"title":"배추 · 白菜","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58433-1-12-1","ko":"유민아, 김치를 담그게 배추 좀 사 오너라.","zh":"裕敏啊，我要做泡菜，去买些白菜回来吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"유민아,","meaning":"裕敏","explanation":"유민：裕敏；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"유민아","audio":"/audio/6bc140c60d405848e43c.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"김치를","meaning":"韩国泡菜（辛奇）","explanation":"김치：韩国泡菜（辛奇）；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"김치","audio":"/audio/3c5be729d66a60db4af4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28818","senseId":"1","lemma":"김치","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"담그게","meaning":"腌制","explanation":"담그다：腌制；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"담그다","audio":"/audio/ead53307477459fb156d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62832","senseId":"2","lemma":"담그다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배추","meaning":"白菜","explanation":"배추：白菜","readings":[{"term":"배추","audio":"/audio/a18cd4c77384f16eea2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58433","senseId":"1","lemma":"배추","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오너라.","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；너라：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3c5be729d66a60db","term":"김치","zh":"韩国泡菜（辛奇）","audio":"/audio/3c5be729d66a60db4af4.mp3","entryId":"28818","definition":"把白菜或萝卜等蔬菜用盐腌过后拌上作料，经过发酵而成的食物。","pronunciation":["김치"]},{"id":"ead53307477459fb","term":"담그다","zh":"腌制","audio":"/audio/ead53307477459fb156d.mp3","entryId":"62832","definition":"为了使辛奇、酒、酱、虾酱等食物腌熟或发酵，将材料混合并放入容器中。","pronunciation":["담그다"]},{"id":"a18cd4c77384f16e","term":"배추","zh":"白菜","audio":"/audio/a18cd4c77384f16eea2a.mp3","entryId":"58433","definition":"一种蔬菜。叶子为长圆形，并重叠生长，内部为黄白色，外部为绿色，常用于腌制辛奇。","pronunciation":["배ː추"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b9a6437a90127895a522.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58433-1-12-2","ko":"네. 몇 포기나 사 올까요?","zh":"好的。要买几棵呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"포기나","meaning":"棵，株","explanation":"포기：棵，株；나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"포기","audio":"/audio/c1f1102e79f0f0f9ee8e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83346","senseId":"2","lemma":"포기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올까요?","meaning":"来","explanation":"오다：来；ㄹ까요：礼貌地询问意见、提出建议或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"23","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"用于询问不知道的数目。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"c1f1102e79f0f0f9","term":"포기","zh":"棵，株","audio":"/audio/c1f1102e79f0f0f9ee8e.mp3","entryId":"83346","definition":"计算以根为单位的草或树的单位。","pronunciation":["포기"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"为了某个目的或事情而从别的地方移动到这里。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/5088d51eea990b3fa27b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.776,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58433","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":56,"sequenceScore":2.5013,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["裕敏啊，我要做泡菜，去买些白菜回来吧。","好的。要买几棵呢？","智秀，你的新年假期到什么时候啊？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["裕敏啊，我要做泡菜，去买些白菜回来吧。","好的。要买几棵呢？","智秀，你的新年假期到什么时候啊？"],"answer":1}]}
